[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584325\">1092B68</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584328\">1092C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584331\">1092D10</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing bolt (1a) and remove the rpm sensor (1b) from\nthe housing.</p><p>2. Undo the fixing bolts (2a) and remove the crankshaft pulley (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021039.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit pulley and tighten retaining bolts\nto torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CRANKSHAFT PULLEY</p></td><td><p>M8 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten the bolt fixing the rpm sensor.</p><p>Using a feeler gauge, check that the gap\nbetween the flywheel and the sensor is within the recommended limits.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Gap (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.5 - 1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584331\">1092D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584328\">1092C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584325\">1092B68</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]